 "captions": [
  {
   "id": "c0-0",
   "html": "One channel. Three people. One app, beside the chat.",
   "start": 0.85,
   "end": 5.85
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-0",
   "html": "An app is a small script that bzz runs for a channel, and draws right beside the <b>conversation.</b>",
   "start": 6.45,
   "end": 17.85
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-0",
   "html": "Its records belong to the channel. Ada adds a card, and it lands on Lin's screen <b>and on yours.</b>",
   "start": 18.45,
   "end": 31.85
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-0",
   "html": "Two people move the same card at the same instant.",
   "start": 32.45,
   "end": 36.1
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-1",
   "html": "One move is saved. The other is told, and the Board merges it. <b>Nothing is lost.</b>",
   "start": 36.12,
   "end": 47.85
  },
  {
   "id": "c4-0",
   "html": "Three apps ship with bzz: a Board, a Poll, and Approvals,",
   "start": 48.45,
   "end": 53.99
  },
  {
   "id": "c4-1",
   "html": "where nobody <b>signs off their own request.</b>",
   "start": 54.01,
   "end": 67.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c5-0",
   "html": "Want something else? Ask your agent, right in the channel:",
   "start": 67.83,
   "end": 71.93
  },
  {
   "id": "c5-1",
   "html": "<b>add a priority and a filter to the board.</b>",
   "start": 71.95,
   "end": 81.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c6-0",
   "html": "Nothing it wrote runs <b>until you have read it:</b>",
   "start": 81.83,
   "end": 86.41
  },
  {
   "id": "c6-1",
   "html": "who it comes from, who asked, its hash, what changed. <b>Down to the last line.</b>",
   "start": 86.43,
   "end": 97.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c7-0",
   "html": "Approve it, and the open app <b>changes in place.</b>",
   "start": 97.83,
   "end": 101.36
  },
  {
   "id": "c7-1",
   "html": "The same card is still selected.",
   "start": 101.38,
   "end": 107.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c8-0",
   "html": "To give it to the others, <b>offer it in the channel.</b>",
   "start": 107.83,
   "end": 111.2
  },
  {
   "id": "c8-1",
   "html": "Ada sees who signed it, reads the same bytes, and <b>decides for herself.</b>",
   "start": 111.22,
   "end": 125.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c9-0",
   "html": "Agents work with an app's records too, without a screen: they read its brief.",
   "start": 125.83,
   "end": 131.83
  },
  {
   "id": "c9-1",
   "html": "<b>Move the release notes card to Done.</b>",
   "start": 131.85,
   "end": 139.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c10-0",
   "html": "The records travel, and <b>each client draws its own board.</b>",
   "start": 139.83,
   "end": 144.18
  },
  {
   "id": "c10-1",
   "html": "Here, Buzz desktop, with a plugin written from the brief.",
   "start": 144.2,
   "end": 149.83
  }
 ],
